    "intro": {
      "title": "Welcome to Big Ambitions Tools!",
      "desc": "Here you can find a collection of infos and tools for the game <i>Big Ambitions</i> by Hovgaard Games. This fansite is currently focused on factory mechanics to help players optimize their gameplay. Calculations are based on version 0.10 of the game and may change with future updates.",
